title: "Abir Market Sentinel: AI Insider Trading Detection Engine with Quantum-Ready Security"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-05-04
url: "https://github.com/Abiress/abir-market-sentinel"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Abiress/abir-market-sentinel"
repository-artifact: "https://pypi.org/project/abir-market-sentinel/"
abstract: >-
  Abir Market Sentinel is an AI-powered insider trading detection engine
  that uses behavioral anomaly detection, intent analysis, and
  trade-news correlation to flag suspicious market activity.
  It extends Abir-Guard's post-quantum cryptography (ML-KEM-1024,
  ML-DSA-65) to provide quantum-ready security for sensitive
  financial detection data. The system goes beyond rule-based
  detection by analyzing intent rather than just activity,
  addressing the gap in current insider trading detection systems.
